--- !u!114 &2176869272599355111
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4152983976587609998}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Peter,\n\nIf you're reading this, I most likely have been captured by
    the government. During my time spent with the government, I have acquired some
    critical information. The government has been secretly working on a project called
    \"Project REBIRTH\", which they plan on using to seize research across the city.
    This includes the cure that you and I have been working on. \n\nThe government
    has no intention of using the cure to save humanity. Before my capture, I have
    hidden the cure in the closet within your bedroom. You must keep it safe with
    you. With the cure, you must head to the hospital. That is where we can mass
    produce it and save humanity. You are humanity's last hope.\n\nBe wary, the journey
    to the lab will be dangerous. You will encounter all sorts of creatures and people
    that might stop you. \n\nBe sure to explore to find weapons and items along the
    way that will make your journey easier to traverse. \n\nBest,\nIsaac \n"
